SACRILEGE.

1ST TROOP HAS BEEN ISSUED A COURSE HEADING OF 166ø SOUTH BY 
SOUTH EAST. THIS WILL TAKE THE TROOP THROUGH MLF DUG IN 
POSITIONS. 1ST TROOPS PRIMARY OBJECTIVE IS THE SANITIZING OF 
THIS REGION, DESIGNATED ROMEO DELTA-3. 

SYRIAN INTELLIGENCE HAS ISSUED THE WARNING THAT THE HEAVIEST 
CONCENTRATION OF MLF FORCES WILL BE IN THE PASS THE ENEMY 
HAS DESIGNATED SIERRA-4.

2ND TROOP MUST ASSUME A COURSE HEADING OF 223ø EAST AND SOUTH 
INTO SYRIAN OCCUPIED TERRITORY. 2ND TROOPS PRIMARY OBJECTIVE 
WILL BE THE REMAINING AMERICAN ARTILLERY PLATFORM. 

1ST AND 2ND TROOP ARE THEN ORDERED TO SECONDARY TARGET IN SOUTH/
EAST AREA OF OPERATION: MLF LOGISTICS DEPOT. BOTH TROOPS ARE 
ORDERED TO NEUTRALIZE ALL ELEMENTS WITHIN THIS ENCAMPMENT.
